@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class
RECTANGLE Client
RECTANGLE API
RECTANGLE Ledger
RECTANGLE Identity
RECTANGLE Capabilities
Client --> API : HTTP(S) requests
API --> Ledger : Append event
API --> Identity : Verify envelope, key, nonce
API --> Capabilities : Check/issue/revoke capability
Ledger --> API : Event replay
Identity --> API : Identity state (from events)
Capabilities --> API : Capability state (from events)
@enduml
